<p>
<h2>Weird Tales - 5th Incarnation</h2>
George H. Scithers used his publishing company (<i>Terminus</i>) to 
bring back <i>Weird Tales</i> in a format similar to the original publication. 
Darrell Schweitzer and John Gregory Betancourt were assistant editors for the
first 2 years; Schweitzer took full editorship with the Spring 1991 issue.
The license to use the <i>Weird Tales</i> name was terminated with the 
Spring 1994 issue, instigating the change to the new title
<i>Worlds of Fantasy & Horror</i>.

