<h2>Weird Tales - 4th Incarnation</h2>
After the failure of the Zebra puplications, Robert E. Weinberg and Victor Dricks licensed the
<i>Weird Tales</i> name to the Bellerophon Network, a publishing company owned
by Brian Forbes.  The magazine was poorly funded and distributed, and failed after
only 2 issues.
